# The Movie Database (TMDB) API Key
# Get your API key from: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
THEMOVIEDB_API_KEY=your_tmdb_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Sign up/login to TMDB: https://www.themoviedb.org/
# 2. Go to Settings > API
# 3. Request an API key (it's free!)
# 4. Copy your API key and replace "your_tmdb_api_key_here" with it
# 5. Save this file and restart your development server

# Next.js automatically loads environment variables from .env.local
# Copy this file to .env.local and add your actual API key